ong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 36.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"49\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 303.4pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"405\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Methylation profile of ganglioglioma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 12.75pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 12.0cm; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 12.75pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"454\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><em>Desirable:</em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 12.75pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 12.0cm; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 12.75pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"454\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Absence of IDH mutation</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
